# Tutorial balloon example: only show the full first-time explanation once.

~ start
if not GameState.has_flag("trash_train_tutorial_seen"):
	set GameState.set_flag("trash_train_tutorial_seen")
	set locals.steps = 3
	Trash Train: Welcome to Trash Train.
	Trash Train: Use <WASD> or <ARROWS> to move around the park.
	Trash Train: Collect litter, avoid pedestrians, and bank your collection before time runs out.
	- Start the challenge
		set GameState.start_quest("trash_train")
		=> END
	- Read it again
		=> start

Trash Train: Want a quick refresher before you play?
- Show the controls again
	set locals.steps = 3
	Trash Train: Use <WASD> or <ARROWS> to move.
	Trash Train: Collect litter and avoid pedestrians.
	Trash Train: Bank your collection before time runs out.
	=> END
- I am ready
	set GameState.start_quest("trash_train")
	=> END
